<tr><th scope="row" style="text-align: left; vertical-align: top; padding: 12px 16px 12px 0; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; white-space: nowrap; border-bottom: 1px solid #111111">OSC 5522</th><td style="vertical-align: top; padding: 12px 16px; color: #4A4A46; border-bottom: 1px solid #111111">Kitty&#x27;s clipboard protocol</td><td style="vertical-align: top; padding: 12px 16px; color: #8F8F89; border-bottom: 1px solid #111111"><span aria-hidden="true" style="margin-right: 6px; color: #D98A86; font-size: 12px">✕</span>Dropped</td><td style="vertical-align: top; padding: 12px 0 12px 16px; color: #111111; border-bottom: 1px solid #111111">Reads wait for the owner like OSC 52&#x27;s, text only, with <code style="font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 13px">--clipboard-read</code>; pastes arrive as Kitty paste events when the program asks for them</td></tr>
