</div>
<p style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6; color: #5B5B57; max-width: 900px">Everything else (other OSCs, DCS including tmux passthrough, APC, PM, SOS) is dropped before it reaches your terminal. The remote program doesn't get to command it. mosh column: mosh 1.4.0, its latest release, read from its source; its main branch has since added OSC 8 hyperlinks, not yet released.</p>
